# P-006-16: CSS Scroll Snap 1 in servo mode (ui4me Core 0.8 F0804): `scroll-snap-type`, `scroll-snap-align`, `scroll-snap-stop`, the `scroll-padding*` and `scroll-margin*` longhands and their shorthands (physical and logical) lose `engine = "gecko"` and are parsed and computed in servo mode behind the new static pref `layout.css.scroll-snap.enabled` (default false); the existing structs hold the values (no new ComputedValues field)
# Applies to: servo/stylo @ 37c1ed3b707c8f333304de2107c13b68fbc1057c after P-006-1 .. P-006-15 (root of the checkout, `patch -p1`)
# Licence: MPL-2.0 (modifications to MPL-2.0 files; the modified source is published with the repository, see engine/NOTICE)

